# P10: original INSTALL.EXE from C:\XWING on the Sound Blaster machine
# (reference/dosbox-x-sb.conf): "Set Sound Board Configuration" -> "SoundBlaster" ("AdLib
# synthesized music and sound effects, with digitized speech"), then Exit, declining the
# READ.ME. Leaving the installer writes LANDRU.CFG and OPTIONS.CFG. Steps are documented in
# src/misc/xwing_script.cpp of the patched DOSBox-X.
text MAIN MENU
delay 1000
key down
delay 500
key enter
text SOUND CARD MENU
delay 1000
# No Sound, AdLib and compatibles, Roland, General MIDI (GMIDI), then SoundBlaster
key down down down down
delay 500
key enter
text Sound Card Setting:        SoundBlaster
delay 1000
# Exit is the fifth main-menu item
key down down down down
delay 500
key enter
text Do you wish to read it now?
delay 500
key n
notext Do you wish to read it now?
delay 3000
done
